flowchart LR
  A[Receive the incoming support ticket from the customer portal] --> B{Is the ticket a duplicate of an existing open ticket?}
  B -->|yes| C[Merge it into the existing ticket and notify the customer]
  B -->|no| D[Assign the ticket to the first line support queue]
  D --> E[(Ticket database with the full history)]
  C --> E
  E --> F[/Send a weekly summary report to the managers/]
